msgstr ""

#: manual/api/perf.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/perf` is the entry package for `moon bench`. It has no public items: its only content is a benchmark test that runs every registered case of [`perf_support`](perf_support.md) through `@bench.T::bench`."
